{"id":"n63356-2-5","stage":4,"title":"새싹 · 幼苗","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63356-2-5-1","ko":"자라나는 새싹들에게 꿈을 심어 줘야지. 왜 자꾸 잔소리만 해?","zh":"要给成长中的孩子播下梦想，怎么老是唠叨？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자라나는","meaning":"成长，生长","explanation":"자라나다：成长，生长；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"자라나다","audio":"/audio/dde947dc75086bfd22c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68798","senseId":"2","lemma":"자라나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자라나는","audio":"/audio/0ec8ab7ff5a5df0f5d6e.mp3"}},{"text":"새싹들에게","meaning":"幼苗","explanation":"새싹：幼苗；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"새싹","audio":"/audio/372ff6db901ebb52c731.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63356","senseId":"2","lemma":"새싹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새싹들에게","audio":"/audio/cf31d82060db3d433075.mp3"}},{"text":"꿈을","meaning":"梦想","explanation":"꿈：梦想；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"꿈","audio":"/audio/30fb5e8ccd7b82b30b61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57279","senseId":"2","lemma":"꿈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꿈을","audio":"/audio/f1b8deab36046ef08295.mp3"}},{"text":"심어","meaning":"根植，埋种","explanation":"심다：根植，埋种；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"심다","audio":"/audio/9945af5ffe48ce1fd446.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64968","senseId":"2","lemma":"심다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심어","audio":"/audio/8dbe85c12e80e53dc168.mp3"}},{"text":"줘야지.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줘야지","audio":"/audio/e3dc02b41c3bbfda01d0.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3